    effect: 'Base Stat (Intelligence)\nThis skill is affected by the Intelligence characteristic. It makes a character\'s rational arguments more convincing and allows to notice any logical inconsistencies in other people\'s words. Also, it helps to operate cogitators more efficiently. May give access to new dialogue options.',
    wikiUrl: 'https://roguetrader.wiki.fextralife.com/Logic',
